        "Id": "a260e0e4e39f7d332336b09f001493a0",
        "Title": "Describe the field",
        "DescriptionText": "The two lists are read in step, so lookupKeys and lookupValues must be the same length. Matching is on the answer's text form, which is why a drop-down's values rather than its display names are what appear on the left.",
